# ModulOS
An operating system that aims to be customizable and modular to provide a fast user experience

## Licensing

This software is provided under the GPLv3 license, found in COPYING. This project also uses
mlibc which has a seperate license in LICENCES/MLIBC, dash which has a seperate license
in LICENSES/DASH, and sbase which has a seperate license in LICENSES/SBASE

